# Install quarantine: npm only picks versions published at least this many
# days ago. Read by npm 11.10.0 and later. Older npm ignores it: npm 10 (Node
# 20's and 22's) without a word, npm 11.0-11.9 with an "Unknown project
# config" warning.
#
# This template commits no lockfile, so every `npm install` chooses versions
# and the window applies to each of them, with npm 11.10.0 or later. The
# workflows here set up Node 20, whose npm 10 ignores it. Dependabot applies
# the larger of this and its cooldown, and none to security updates.
#
# To let a fix through early: min-release-age-exclude[]=<name> (npm 11.17+).
min-release-age=3
